---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="友链 · 来开博客" description="来开博客的朋友站点列表">
  <div class="container">
    <h1 class="page-title">友链</h1>
    <p class="intro">
      这里收录朋友们的站点。想交换友链的话，给本站仓库提
      <a href="https://github.com/skykiah/likaiblog">issue</a>
      或邮件联系我，附上站点名称、链接和一句话介绍即可。
    </p>
    <ul class="friend-list">
      <li>
        <a href="https://astro.build/" class="friend-card" rel="noopener">
          <span class="friend-name">Astro</span>
          <span class="friend-desc">本站的构建框架，内容站点的首选</span>
        </a>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-title {
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 6vw, 3rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    margin: 4rem 0 1rem;
  }

  .intro {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin: 0 0 2.5rem;
    max-width: 36em;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .intro a {
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .intro a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }

  .friend-list {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0 0 3rem;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(15rem, 1fr));
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .friend-card {
    display: block;
    height: 100%;
    background: var(--bg-secondary);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 1.4rem 1.5rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    transition: transform 0.25s ease;
  }

  .friend-card:hover {
    transform: scale(1.02);
  }

  .friend-name {
    display: block;
    font-size: 1.08rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: var(--text);
    transition: color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .friend-card:hover .friend-name {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .friend-desc {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-top: 0.3rem;
  }
</style>
